{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NoSlack Pets: Lo-Fi Paws is a cozy desktop cat companion that quietly keeps you company while you work, study, or relax.</strong> Miino sits by the edge of your screen, types when you type, and comes with a built-in Pomodoro timer, lo-fi music, white noise, and an Online Study Room so you can focus together with other players. Every 30 minutes you can open a Gift Box for new headgear and decorations (350+ headgear, 600+ decorations) to personalize Miino and their tiny home, hop into Pool Party or light mini-games for short breaks, and tuck tools into the Cat Bus to keep your desktop tidy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Gift Box \u2192 Headgear \u2192 Dress the cat \u2192 Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused / idle for 30 minutes to earn a Gift Box that opens into random Headgear (can be fused / recorded in your Collection / traded on the Steam Market).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/3db9b09a30bb6737b82bd6a5e4c072e5.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/3db9b09a30bb6737b82bd6a5e4c072e5.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/3db9b09a30bb6737b82bd6a5e4c072e5.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Piggy bank \u2192 Paw Coin \u2192 Decorate your home \u2192 Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Piggy bank accrues Paw Coin and XP every minute and you can claim anytime to purchase house and desktop\u2011cat decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/fc0c3bd842494df9a323f92147d24a0d.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/fc0c3bd842494df9a323f92147d24a0d.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/fc0c3bd842494df9a323f92147d24a0d.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Deep customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >600+ cat / room / desktop\u2011device decorations + 350+ Headgear. Place freely to craft your own cat and soothing space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/673867df989f0e23713c92fb16fcbc0a.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/673867df989f0e23713c92fb16fcbc0a.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/673867df989f0e23713c92fb16fcbc0a.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Light social \u00d7 help open Gift Boxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Online Study Room and focus side\u2011by\u2011side with players worldwide; you can open each other\u2019s Gift Boxes (ownership stays with the original owner), with time / help leaderboards and lightweight chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/ee8edddff697bea6ef0ff6612d94e40b.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/ee8edddff697bea6ef0ff6612d94e40b.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/ee8edddff697bea6ef0ff6612d94e40b.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Desktop Pet Mode and Companion Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports drag / snap / sit on window ledges; Miino follows your typing and stays by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/4149a894afb5ae8ddf3eed31361bcf31.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/4149a894afb5ae8ddf3eed31361bcf31.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/4149a894afb5ae8ddf3eed31361bcf31.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Focus toolkit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built\u2011in Pomodoro Timer, Lo\u2011Fi music (50+), and white noise (36). Use the Cat Bus to tuck multiple mini tools into a desktop corner\u2014no interference, easy to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/00993cf4d1ab31e2e55c5f0e49edd81b.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/00993cf4d1ab31e2e55c5f0e49edd81b.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/00993cf4d1ab31e2e55c5f0e49edd81b.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Pool Party \u201cgrab\u201d Gift Boxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a mechanical claw in a laid\u2011back scene to grab Gift Boxes and get random rewards\u2014collect little moments of joy effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/1e6260a84055b388e00849c19b8c3fae.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/1e6260a84055b388e00849c19b8c3fae.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/1e6260a84055b388e00849c19b8c3fae.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Relaxing mini\u2011games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schulte Grid, 2048, and other lightweight modes\u2014relax while earning small rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/22529c3e71b6f8cb96d0bb68e183e653.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/22529c3e71b6f8cb96d0bb68e183e653.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/22529c3e71b6f8cb96d0bb68e183e653.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf What you\u2019ll do</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Focus / idle \u2192 open Gift Boxes \u2192 collect / fuse / trade Headgear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Focus / idle \u2192 claim Paw Coin \u2192 buy decorations / build your cat &amp; home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Style your cat &amp; room \u2192 pair with desktop devices \u2192 craft a comfy workspace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Start a Pomodoro \u2192 listen to Lo\u2011Fi / white noise \u2192 enter flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enter the Study Room \u2192 learn together \u2192 help open Gift Boxes \u2192 climb the leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Go to Pool Party \u2192 \u201cgrab\u201d Gift Boxes with the claw \u2192 get small surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play quick mini\u2011games \u2192 relax while earning rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Drag Miino to the taskbar / window edge \u2192 let it \u201clive\u201d on your desktop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 This game is for you if\u2026</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work / study / game and want better productivity with warm companionship;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You love cute cats or cozy vibes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You improve focus via Pomodoro \u00d7 Lo\u2011Fi music \u00d7 white noise;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enjoy collecting, decorating, cute style, and light interactions;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want an animated, adorable companion\u2011type desktop pet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd38 Headgear drop rates</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common (C) 89.90% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon (B) 9.51% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare (A) 0.49% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic (S) 0.10% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary (SS) 0% (Only obtainable via Synthesis)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0 Ongoing updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Continuous additions: Headgear, house &amp; desktop\u2011cat decorations, music &amp; white noise, to\u2011do / sticky notes, mini\u2011games, and light\u2011social features;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Smoother desktop interactions and performance for a more \u201creal companionship\u201d feel;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Community\u2011driven: we tackle commonly reported issues and fun suggestions weekly for fast iteration;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc31 A note from the NoSlack Pets team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone supporting us with comments and feedback! Your encouragement powers us through intense development. We ship daily updates and publish a weekly changelog. Join our official QQ group, Bilibili, or Discord to chat cats and share ideas\u2014we listen carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde1 Start now</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to Wishlist to get version / event updates, Meow Codes, and other perks;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our community channels and help us improve Miino\u2019s little world!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Desktop Buddy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/f7b30445bae1d3d0138b8441aab322aee6716527.jpg"},{"name":"A Thousand Cat Faces","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/b28c2489aca74d20382d95e30605954897eec649.jpg"},{"name":"Fun Paws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/b48c271692de62e3c245e46907ebcacb4ef02a1c.jpg"},{"name":"Another Kitty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/6cb1db45882c28d331928fd04742334029cc7726.jpg"},{"name":"I am Different When Serious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/b48a445c69742c6d5200955a034e300a04475973.jpg"},{"name":"Cat House Remodeler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/36500d363b64abac60e0890b6f4a42528aa5e1ab.jpg"},{"name":"Cat House Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/3d78d710112918e87514af4be20e65ea4997b70b.jpg"},{"name":"I Bought a House!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/a313ccc482c1f6451b40944e28402d25f7851aec.jpg"},{"name":"So Many Cat Houses","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/7a998cfde109a9964205028252214c5909700e0c.jpg"},{"name":"First Gift Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3714370/a8107042751cc5218a8a6ae0222cdc06ece54670.jpg"}],"total":77},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714370?t=1768206056","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/7093781ddeaddda4842fee4bcfea795a54538bfc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768206056","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/d6249f2e295d1f2d1461e4c12f53223bbce69c4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768206056","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/d6249f2e295d1f2d1461e4c12f53223bbce69c4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768206056","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NoSlack Pets: Lo-Fi Paws is a cozy desktop cat companion that quietly keeps you company while you work, study, or relax.</strong> Miino sits by the edge of your screen, types when you type, and comes with a built-in Pomodoro timer, lo-fi music, white noise, and an Online Study Room so you can focus together with other players. Every 30 minutes you can open a Gift Box for new headgear and decorations (350+ headgear, 600+ decorations) to personalize Miino and their tiny home, hop into Pool Party or light mini-games for short breaks, and tuck tools into the Cat Bus to keep your desktop tidy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Gift Box \u2192 Headgear \u2192 Dress the cat \u2192 Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused / idle for 30 minutes to earn a Gift Box that opens into random Headgear (can be fused / recorded in your Collection / traded on the Steam Market).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/3db9b09a30bb6737b82bd6a5e4c072e5.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/3db9b09a30bb6737b82bd6a5e4c072e5.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/3db9b09a30bb6737b82bd6a5e4c072e5.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Piggy bank \u2192 Paw Coin \u2192 Decorate your home \u2192 Loop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Piggy bank accrues Paw Coin and XP every minute and you can claim anytime to purchase house and desktop\u2011cat decorations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/fc0c3bd842494df9a323f92147d24a0d.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/fc0c3bd842494df9a323f92147d24a0d.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/fc0c3bd842494df9a323f92147d24a0d.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Deep customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >600+ cat / room / desktop\u2011device decorations + 350+ Headgear. Place freely to craft your own cat and soothing space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/673867df989f0e23713c92fb16fcbc0a.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/673867df989f0e23713c92fb16fcbc0a.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/673867df989f0e23713c92fb16fcbc0a.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Light social \u00d7 help open Gift Boxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Online Study Room and focus side\u2011by\u2011side with players worldwide; you can open each other\u2019s Gift Boxes (ownership stays with the original owner), with time / help leaderboards and lightweight chat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/ee8edddff697bea6ef0ff6612d94e40b.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/ee8edddff697bea6ef0ff6612d94e40b.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/ee8edddff697bea6ef0ff6612d94e40b.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Desktop Pet Mode and Companion Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports drag / snap / sit on window ledges; Miino follows your typing and stays by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/4149a894afb5ae8ddf3eed31361bcf31.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/4149a894afb5ae8ddf3eed31361bcf31.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/4149a894afb5ae8ddf3eed31361bcf31.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Focus toolkit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built\u2011in Pomodoro Timer, Lo\u2011Fi music (50+), and white noise (36). Use the Cat Bus to tuck multiple mini tools into a desktop corner\u2014no interference, easy to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/00993cf4d1ab31e2e55c5f0e49edd81b.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/00993cf4d1ab31e2e55c5f0e49edd81b.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/00993cf4d1ab31e2e55c5f0e49edd81b.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Pool Party \u201cgrab\u201d Gift Boxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a mechanical claw in a laid\u2011back scene to grab Gift Boxes and get random rewards\u2014collect little moments of joy effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/1e6260a84055b388e00849c19b8c3fae.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/1e6260a84055b388e00849c19b8c3fae.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/1e6260a84055b388e00849c19b8c3fae.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2022 Relaxing mini\u2011games</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Schulte Grid, 2048, and other lightweight modes\u2014relax while earning small rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/22529c3e71b6f8cb96d0bb68e183e653.poster.avif?t=1768206056\" width=800 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/22529c3e71b6f8cb96d0bb68e183e653.webm?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/extras/22529c3e71b6f8cb96d0bb68e183e653.mp4?t=1768206056\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfaf What you\u2019ll do</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Focus / idle \u2192 open Gift Boxes \u2192 collect / fuse / trade Headgear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Focus / idle \u2192 claim Paw Coin \u2192 buy decorations / build your cat &amp; home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Style your cat &amp; room \u2192 pair with desktop devices \u2192 craft a comfy workspace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Start a Pomodoro \u2192 listen to Lo\u2011Fi / white noise \u2192 enter flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enter the Study Room \u2192 learn together \u2192 help open Gift Boxes \u2192 climb the leaderboards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Go to Pool Party \u2192 \u201cgrab\u201d Gift Boxes with the claw \u2192 get small surprises</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Play quick mini\u2011games \u2192 relax while earning rewards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Drag Miino to the taskbar / window edge \u2192 let it \u201clive\u201d on your desktop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 This game is for you if\u2026</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You work / study / game and want better productivity with warm companionship;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You love cute cats or cozy vibes;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You improve focus via Pomodoro \u00d7 Lo\u2011Fi music \u00d7 white noise;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You enjoy collecting, decorating, cute style, and light interactions;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You want an animated, adorable companion\u2011type desktop pet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd38 Headgear drop rates</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common (C) 89.90% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncommon (B) 9.51% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare (A) 0.49% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic (S) 0.10% </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary (SS) 0% (Only obtainable via Synthesis)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0 Ongoing updates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Continuous additions: Headgear, house &amp; desktop\u2011cat decorations, music &amp; white noise, to\u2011do / sticky notes, mini\u2011games, and light\u2011social features;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Smoother desktop interactions and performance for a more \u201creal companionship\u201d feel;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Community\u2011driven: we tackle commonly reported issues and fun suggestions weekly for fast iteration;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc31 A note from the NoSlack Pets team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone supporting us with comments and feedback! Your encouragement powers us through intense development. We ship daily updates and publish a weekly changelog. Join our official QQ group, Bilibili, or Discord to chat cats and share ideas\u2014we listen carefully!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde1 Start now</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to Wishlist to get version / event updates, Meow Codes, and other perks;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow our community channels and help us improve Miino\u2019s little world!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Lynkpin Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714370/9dc6ec1a7d150ee89ad3062fe3eabfeabdaf4e99/header.jpg?t=1768206056","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3714370/1174030485/14e7a06f27e2d40f680a0bd